{"title": "Legendary Action: Shredding Scales", "pageid": 31397, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Shredding_Scales", "categories": ["Honour mode", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"bg3wiki-honour-content-notice\" class=\"noexcerpt navigation-not-searchable\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(to right, #443E20, #232323); border-radius:10px; max-width: 630px; padding: 5px; width: auto; padding: 4px 10px; margin-bottom: 10px;\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/33px-Honour_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/44px-Honour_Icon.webp 2x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp/22px-Honour_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/a/a0/Honour_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> This page is about content exclusive to <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour mode\">Honour mode</a>.</div>\n\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales.webp, /w/images/e/ef/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales.webp/300px-Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Legendary Action: Shredding Scales</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Passive_feature\" title=\"Passive feature\">passive feature</a> available to the <a href=\"/wiki/Bulette\" title=\"Bulette\">Bulette</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/Honour_Mode\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Honour Mode\">Honour Mode</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Once per turn, the Bulette can spend a Legendary Action to use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/38px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/50px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shredding Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\">Shredding Scales</a> after being hit if its <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Diamond Scales (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/38px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/50px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Diamond Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Diamond Scales (Condition)\">Diamond Scales</a> are active. \n</p><p><span style=\"color: white;\">Legendary Actions restore at the start of each round.</span>\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Legendary_Action:_Shredding_Scales\"> Condition: Legendary Action: Shredding Scales </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Shredding_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Shredding Scales (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d6/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Legendary Action: Shredding Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d6/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d6/Legendary_Action_Shredding_Scales_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Legendary_Action:_Shredding_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Legendary Action: Shredding Scales (Condition)\">Legendary Action: Shredding Scales</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>While it has <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Diamond Scales (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/38px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/50px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Diamond Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/c8/Bulette_Diamond_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Diamond_Scales_(Condition)\" title=\"Diamond Scales (Condition)\">Diamond Scales</a>, the Bulette can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/38px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/50px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Shredding Scales\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp/25px-Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/57/Shredding_Scales_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Shredding_Scales\" title=\"Shredding Scales\">Shredding Scales</a> immediately after being hit for the first time in a round.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p><i>(Information not yet added.)</i>\n</p>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714201942\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.048 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1301/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 13460/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4558/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.004/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 639935/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   42.148      1 -total\n 99.07%   41.754      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n 30.46%   12.840      3 Template:Icon_link\n 29.38%   12.384      3 Template:Icon_text\n 25.49%   10.742      8 Template:Trim\n 24.79%   10.447      1 Template:SAI\n 19.49%    8.213      3 Template:Ifempty\n 17.01%    7.168      1 Template:Cond\n 16.52%    6.961      1 Template:Condition\n 11.87%    5.003      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:31397-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714201942 and revision id 272535. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}